<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτύφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burn with a smouldering fire beneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ ὑ. τὴν νῆσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>kindle into a smouldering fire, cause to burn
				secretly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθύψας τὴν διαβολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.42.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθρα ὑπετύφετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ctes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					29.46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπετέθυπτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apolloph.
					10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπη, ὀργή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Abd.</u>
				30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρωνεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.142
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.584
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.13b
			</span></i>; of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτετύφθαι</span>
			<i>burn with a hidden fire</i> (of love), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όμενος ἐς τὸν ἔρωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					9.41
				</span></i>
			.</div>
